    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d253">

                <pb facs="0499" n="489" sameAs="frus:frus1946v10/pg489"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">Marshall Mission Files, Lot 54–D270</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Minutes of Meeting Between General Marshall and Dr.
                        Stuart at No. 5 Ning Hoi Road, Nanking, November 8, 1946, 6 p.m.</hi>
                </head>
                <dateline>
                    <placeName>Nanking</placeName>, <date
                        ana="#date_undated-inferred-from-document-head" calendar="gregorian"
                        when="1946-11-08T18:00:00+08:00">November 8, 1946, 6 p.m.</date>
                </dateline>
                <table rend="width:50%" rendition="#center">
                    <row>
                        <cell rendition="#nowrap">Also present:</cell>
                        <cell>General Pee</cell>
                    </row>
                    <row>
                        <cell/>
                        <cell>Col. Caughey</cell>
                    </row>
                </table>
                <p>Doctor Stuart explained that General Pee had brought to him the statement which
                    the Generalissimo proposed to issue this evening. General Pee showed the
                    statement to General Marshall and pointed out the parts where it had been
                    changed over that submitted to the Generalissimo by General Marshall and Doctor
                    Stuart. (The statement as shown to General Marshall was subsequently issued on
                    the evening of 8 November<anchor n="80" xml:id="d253-f1"/>).</p>
                <p>General Marshall told General Pee that he appreciated the Generalissimo’s letting
                    Doctor Stuart and himself see this statement prior to its publication but that
                    he had no comment to make regarding it, as he was opposed to the Government’s
                    attitude.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
